# Shared parents. THIS FILE IS CODE, not operator state: each ship
# replaces it, and the TUI cannot edit it. To change it, change it here,
# in git, and ship.
#
# Many unrelated owners have their own sites under each name here. A
# blocked name also blocks every name under it. Thus a feed line for
# github.io blocks the sites of all owners, not only the one bad site
# that the feed meant. pf compile drops a feed entry that is a name of
# this list or a parent of one (github.io, io). An entry under a name of
# this list (bad.github.io) still compiles.
#
# This list applies only to the fetched feeds. A name that the operator
# writes in blacklist.domains or house.domains compiles as written.
# One name per line.

